OL,3,ADeadly shooting near Paris is a 'racist
OL,4,Aterrorist attack', Macron says
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,7,Flabelled a gun attack in a Parisian
OL,8,Fsuburb which killed one person and
OL,9,Finjured five others "a racist terrorist
OL,10,Fattack".
OL,12,FMacron said the attack was a "turning
OL,13,Fpoint in the life of our Republic and
OL,14,Four nation" as he declared "this has no
OL,15,Fplace in France".
OL,17,FSeveral drive-by shootings took place
OL,18,Fon Friday - first in Trappes to the
OL,19,Fsouth-west of Paris, and then in nearby
OL,20,FLa Verriere - and a 12-year-old girl
OL,21,Fwas among the injured.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
