OL,3,ADeadly shooting near Paris is a 'racist
OL,4,Aterrorist attack', Macron says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials say the attack lasted almost
OL,7,F15 minutes and left three people with
OL,8,Fserious injuries, while the suspected
OL,9,Fattacker has been arrested.
